# Keep LF line endings on every OS so the pinned data hashes match.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.pdf binary

# File modes: setup.sh, start-va-stack.sh and "Start VA Stack.command" should
# be 100755, but this repo is updated through a tool that stores every file
# as 100644, and .gitattributes cannot set a mode. So run setup as
# `bash setup.sh` (README and CI do), and setup.sh runs
# chmod +x start-va-stack.sh "Start VA Stack.command" on every run.
